<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19740" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gnōmŏnĭcus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνωμονικός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a
			gnomon</i>, and, in gen., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a sundial</i>, <i>gnomonic.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rationes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 9,
					3 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">res,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 1, 1
						<i>fin.</i></span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gnōmŏ-nĭca</span></b> ,
			ae, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gnōmŏnĭce</span></b> ,
			es, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνωμονική</span>, <i>the art of making</i> or <i>judging of sundials</i>, <i>the art of
				dialling</i>, <i>gnomonics</i>, <i><span class="en">Gell. 1, 9,
				6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 1, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 76,
				78, § 187</span></i>. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gnōmŏnĭci</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνωμονικοί</span>, <i>persons
				skilled in gnomonics</i>, <i>diallists</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Sol. 37, 3</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
        </u> (Charlton T. Lewis, Charles Short, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1879) </div>
